# Server-side settings for the KaChat desktop container.
#
# ChangeNOW API key that powers the Swap tab. It is read by the same-origin relay in
# vite.config.mjs (CHANGENOW_API_KEY) and attached to ChangeNOW requests on the server - it is
# never put into the browser bundle. docker-compose.yml passes it through from this file or the
# environment. A key a user pastes in Settings still takes precedence for that browser.
CHANGENOW_API_KEY=your-changenow-api-key-here
